Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The cash drawer jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jason had twenty seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.47,0:00:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,before the nightclub owner
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,came back upstairs. Lucia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.43,0:00:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,found the drawer bolted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.63,0:00:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,inside a steel desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jason reached for his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,crowbar. Too slow. She
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,kicked the wheel brake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, the desk had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,rolled when Jason leaned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,against its edge. He
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,stared at her. She
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,pointed toward the freight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,lift. They were stealing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole desk. The
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,lift doors started closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.03,0:00:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jason shoved the crowbar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,between them while Lucia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,dragged their prize inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Below, their van door
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,caught the desktop. Jason
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,swore. Lucia turned it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,sideways; the narrow end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,cleared. The owner reached
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,his window just as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,his own office furniture
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,disappeared into the van
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,below. An hour later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the drawer finally opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Cash everywhere. Jason kept
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,one souvenir: the sign
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,saying employees only.
